          %title Contents
          %blockquote
            %p
              This page is about the notion of
              %em groupoids
              prevalent in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
              and
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brandt+groupoids"} Brandt groupoids
              (
              %a{:href => "#Brandt27"}> Brandt (1927)
              ). For the notion involving a globally defined binary operation, see
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/magma"} magma
